# Auto-Build Rule

After any prompt that modifies `.py` files in this project, automatically:

1. Run PyInstaller build:
```
pyinstaller --onefile --windowed --name "ContentUploader" --icon=assets/icon.ico main.py
```

2. Copy the result to Desktop:
```
Copy-Item "dist\ContentUploader.exe" "C:\Users\lukys\OneDrive\Desktop\ContentUploader.exe" -Force
```

3. Report build success or failure in the response.

Working directory for build: `c:\Users\lukys\Content`

If `assets/icon.ico` does not exist yet, omit the `--icon` flag.
